      "statement": "Notice timing is contract-specific rather than a universal 30-day rule: HO 04 90 (2027-01) requires notice within 30 days after discovery, DP 04 95 (2021-05) requires reporting within 30 days after loss, and HO-3 2024-03 requires prompt notice stating known facts, damaged property, and location.",
