      "statement": "HO 04 90 (2026-01) limits all endorsement loss in one policy period to $10,000 unless the Declarations show a higher endorsement limit, applies a separate $1,000 deductible to each endorsement loss instead of the Section I deductible, and settles Coverage C property at actual cash value unless the Declarations state otherwise for the endorsement.",
